<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61410" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωτίλλω</span></b> , only pres., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>prattle, chatter</i>, usu. with
			collat. notion of <i>coaxing, wheedling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱμύλα κωτίλλουσα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hes.
					<u>Op.</u>
					374
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μαλθακὰ κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					852
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδέα κωτίλλοντα καθήμενον οἰνοποτάζειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phoc.
					11
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάνυτα κ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					15.87
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑλικτὰ ἔπη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lyc.
					1466
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ λιγαίνειν</span>, of a
			speech in court, <i>to be lively, tripping</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				<u>Dem.</u>
				44
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> trans.,
				<i>cajole, beguile with fair words</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὖ κώτιλλε τὸν ἐχθρόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thgn.
					363
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ κώτιλλέ με</span>
			<i>tease</i> me not <i>by prating</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				756
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοιαῦτα κωτίλλουσα τὴν ἀχαΐνην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Babr.
					95.87
				</span></i>
			.</div>
